{
  "an9.6:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 9.6 ",
  "an9.6:0.2": "1. Sambodhivagga ",
  "an9.6:0.3": "Sevanāsutta ",
  "an9.6:1.1": "Tatra kho āyasmā sāriputto bhikkhū āmantesi …pe… āyasmā sāriputto etadavoca: ",
  "an9.6:2.1": "“Puggalopi, āvuso, duvidhena veditabbo—",
  "an9.6:2.2": "sevitabbopi asevitabbopi. ",
  "an9.6:2.3": "Cīvarampi, āvuso, duvidhena veditabbaṁ—",
  "an9.6:2.4": "sevitabbampi asevitabbampi. ",
  "an9.6:2.5": "Piṇḍapātopi, āvuso, duvidhena veditabbo—",
  "an9.6:2.6": "sevitabbopi asevitabbopi. ",
  "an9.6:2.7": "Senāsanampi, āvuso, duvidhena veditabbaṁ—",
  "an9.6:2.8": "sevitabbampi asevitabbampi. ",
  "an9.6:2.9": "Gāmanigamopi, āvuso, duvidhena veditabbo—",
  "an9.6:2.10": "sevitabbopi asevitabbopi. ",
  "an9.6:2.11": "Janapadapadesopi, āvuso, duvidhena veditabbo—",
  "an9.6:2.12": "sevitabbopi asevitabbopi. ",
  "an9.6:3.1": "‘Puggalopi, āvuso, duvidhena veditabbo—",
  "an9.6:3.2": "sevitabbopi asevitabbopī’ti, ",
  "an9.6:3.3": "iti kho panetaṁ vuttaṁ. Kiñcetaṁ paṭicca vuttaṁ? ",
  "an9.6:3.4": "Tattha yaṁ jaññā puggalaṁ: ",
  "an9.6:3.5": "‘imaṁ kho me puggalaṁ sevato akusalā dhammā abhivaḍḍhanti, kusalā dhammā parihāyanti; ",
  "an9.6:3.6": "ye ca kho me pabbajitena jīvitaparikkhārā samudānetabbā cīvarapiṇḍapātasenāsanagilānapaccayabhesajjaparikkhārā te ca kasirena samudāgacchanti; ",
  "an9.6:3.7": "yassa camhi atthāya agārasmā anagāriyaṁ pabbajito so ca me sāmaññattho na bhā